  "description": "The Hei Hei is an aluminum full-suspension mountain bike built for riders who want to climb efficiently, carry speed, and keep progressing when the trail gets rough. Its ultra-efficient suspension and surefooted geometry were shaped by steep, wet, root-laced PNW terrain, giving it planted confidence on technical singletrack without losing the lively, intuitive feel that makes a Kona a Kona. A tough aluminum frame and sensible component package keep it durable, dependable, and ready for years of trail riding, from first big missions to the occasional start line. Consider it a gateway to a lifetime habit of off-road exploration. One lap becomes two. You know how this goes.",
